`opentelemetry-sdk`: implement the declarative configuration Instrumentation Configuration API — add `ConfigProvider` and `ConfigProperties` (a typed read view over the `instrumentation` config node), a global `ConfigProvider` with `get_config_provider`/`set_config_provider` that follows the set-once, no-op-default semantics of `set_tracer_provider`/`get_tracer_provider` (`get_config_provider` returns a `NoOpConfigProvider` when unset), and wire `configure_sdk` to set the global `ConfigProvider` so instrumentation libraries can consume declarative configuration.
